            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "This monster is hunting secrets, not you, so at least it has some taste, unlike my sister."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C01-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "But that's the thing, no matter what Malivore tells the monsters, they always follow their prime directive first. So tell me whatever secret you're keeping, and maybe it'll stop."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C01-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Is it about Hope? It's about Hope, isn't it?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C01-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "I don't know what you're talking about."
          }
        ]
      },
