            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Nice work, but that's not gonna hold it long, so just tell me the secret."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C02-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "I can't."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C02-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Why?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C02-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "It would break Josie's heart."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C02-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "So this is about Josie?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C02-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "No, it's about all of us."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C02-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "Lizzie, since when have you kept your mouth shut about anything? Just tell me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C02-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Lizzie",
              "version": "Lizzie"
            },
            "text": "Fine! It's..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C02-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Silencio."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C02-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "So this is about you."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C02-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "We have to get out of here."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C02-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Hopeless Landon"
            },
            "text": "What are you hiding from everyone?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C02-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "There's no time. These bars aren't gonna hold. We have to find some way to stop it."
          }
        ]
      },
