        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "memories",
        "argument",
        "angst",
        "jealous",
        "rescue",
        "protect",
        "monster"
      ],
      "importance": 4,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Can you talk?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "You know Malivore wants me in one piece, right? So maybe we could find a more comfortable way for me to get to the portal."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Crescere arbor."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Hope! Hope Mikaelson."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Here, come here. Get behind me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "\"Get behind\"... Is that really all you have to say right now?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Can we not do this right now?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "We wouldn't even be having this conversation if you could have your way."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Ventus."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Look, I didn't tell you because I thought that you were happy. Happier."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Without you?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T12",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Happy enough to have sex. That was definitely gonna be without me."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T13",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Who told you that?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T14",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Does it matter?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T15",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "MG",
              "version": "MG"
            },
            "text": "Good thing you guys were arguing. I could hear you from across town. This belonged to that witch that created that thing, so maybe you..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T16",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Finis habentis maleficia."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T17",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "MG",
              "version": "MG"
            },
            "text": "You know, something like that."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E06-C04-T18",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Okay. Now we can talk."
          }
        ]
      },
